      "type": "document",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "release_rows",
      "label": "固定 HF 发布差异 · 83b9013\n四行组：标准答案 A → B → C → D\n完整选项顺序不是循环位移",
      "type": "database",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
